---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHead from '../layouts/PageHead.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Base
  title="Terms & conditions"
  description="Terms of service for shrigovardhan.org — donations, receipts and use of the site."
>
  <PageHead eyebrow="Legal" title="Terms & conditions"
    lede="Carried over from the previous site and corrected where it no longer described what actually happens." />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap wrap--tight prose legal">
      <p class="legal__meta">Last updated 11 August 2026</p>

      <h2>1. About us</h2>
      <p>
        {site.name} is a charitable goshala at {site.address.line},
        {site.address.district}, registered as {site.registration}, run under the
        Sonda Swarnavalli Mahasamsthanam. By using {site.url} you agree to these terms.
      </p>

      <h2>2. What we offer</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Adoption of a cow, nandi or calf for one year</li>
        <li>Go Pooja performed with sankalpa on a date you choose</li>
        <li>Fodder and daily running-cost contributions</li>
        <li>Contributions toward the Swarna Nandini construction</li>
        <li>80G certificates, where you have asked for one and given a PAN</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Donations</h2>
      <p>
        All contributions are voluntary donations towards the welfare of the
        animals — feed, medical care, shelter and the running of the goshala.
      </p>
      <p class="callout">
        Donations are final and non-refundable. Money given is put to use
        immediately, so it cannot be returned once received. If you have paid
        the wrong amount or paid twice, write to us — see
        <a href="/refunds">the payment policy</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>4. How payment works</h2>
      <p>
        Payment is by <strong>UPI only</strong>. You may pay by scanning the QR
        code, opening a UPI app from the payment page, or copying our UPI ID
        into your own app. We do not accept cards, net banking or wallets
        through this website, and we never ask for your card details, PIN,
        passwords or OTP.
      </p>
      <p>
        Because UPI does not report back to us automatically, we ask you to
        confirm your payment on the last step and give the transaction ID. That
        is what lets us match your donation against our bank statement.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Receipts and 80G</h2>
      <p>
        Asking for an 80G receipt is optional. If you ask for one, we need your
        PAN and address, because the trust reports donations against PAN and
        that is what allows you to claim the deduction in your return.
      </p>
      <p>
        Receipts are issued after your payment has been verified against our
        bank statement, not at the moment you submit the form.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Your responsibilities</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Give accurate details, particularly your email and PAN</li>
        <li>Check the amount before confirming in your UPI app</li>
        <li>Keep the reference number shown to you — it starts with <code>GOV</code></li>
        <li>Tell us if your contact details change before a receipt is issued</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>7. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about these terms or about a donation:
        <a href={`mailto:${site.contact.email}`}>{site.contact.email}</a>.
        Quote your reference number if it concerns a payment.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal h2 { font-size: var(--t-lg); }
  .legal p, .legal li { color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.75; }
  .legal strong { color: var(--ink); }
  .legal__meta {
    font-size: var(--t-xs);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    padding-block-end: var(--s-4);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .legal .callout {
    background: var(--warn-bg);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--warn);
    padding: var(--s-4);
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius) var(--radius) 0;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .legal code {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.85em;
    background: var(--surface-sunk);
    padding: 1px 5px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
</style>
